The glyph coverage in font_*.cpp is generated from Adwaita Sans and Adwaita
Mono, the interface fonts GNOME and Fedora ship. Both are licensed under the
SIL Open Font License, version 1.1, and the rasterised bitmaps carry that
license with them.

