    https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-fonts

The license text is at https://openfontlicense.org. In short: the font and
anything derived from it may be used, studied, modified and redistributed
freely, it may be bundled with software under any license, and it may not be
sold on its own.

scripts/gen-font.py regenerates the tables. The build does not run it, so a
machine without the font or without Pillow still builds the tree.
